references:
  - type: article
    title: >-
      A Receiver Operating Characteristic Framework for Evaluating Decision
      Boundaries in Multimodal Real-Time Conversational AI
    status: in-preparation
    year: 2026
    notes: >-
      Extends the VAD optimisation framework to a full ROC-based evaluation
      methodology covering three independent decision boundaries: VAD trigger
      classification, persona adherence, and conversation flow management.
      A fourth boundary (uncertainty via logprobs) is specified pending API
      availability. Introduces LLM-as-a-Judge event annotation as a source of
      reference labels for per-subsystem threshold calibration.
    authors:
      - name: Thomas Herbert Kokholm
        orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0009-3027-2043
